{"name":"Heraldic","hex":"#444161","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"heraldic","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of, or relating to heraldry or heralds."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/heraldic"}],"entries":[{"title":"Heraldry","blocks":[{"text":"Heraldry is a discipline relating to the design, display, study and transmission of armorial bearings. A full heraldic achievement may include a coat of arms on a shield, helmet and crest, together with accompanying devices, such as supporters, badges, banners, and mottoes. Heraldic achievements are formally described in a blazon."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1b/Hyghalmen_Roll_Late_1400s.jpg/330px-Hyghalmen_Roll_Late_1400s.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heraldry","wikidata":"Q18336"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Narmer_Palette_serpopard_side.jpg/120px-Narmer_Palette_serpopard_side.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Narmer_Palette_serpopard_side.jpg/250px-Narmer_Palette_serpopard_side.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Narmer_Palette_serpopard_side.jpg/120px-Narmer_Palette_serpopard_side.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ANarmer_Palette_serpopard_side.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/40/NAMA_Myc%C3%A8nes_bouclier_2.jpg/120px-NAMA_Myc%C3%A8nes_bouclier_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/40/NAMA_Myc%C3%A8nes_bouclier_2.jpg/250px-NAMA_Myc%C3%A8nes_bouclier_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wi